 .\nYou are inside the path\, 31 km from its centre line: the star vanishes
  for up to 0.5 s.\nClosest approach 21:53:44 IST\, give or take 3 s. The s
 tar is 31° up in the SSE · dark sky.\nIt fades 3.5 magnitudes for up to 
 4.2 s on the centre line\, and the path is 39 km wide\, give or take 12 km
 .\nThe map\, the finder chart and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.co
 m/asteroid?e=2027-07-23-991-mcdonalda-085824
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/asteroid?e=2027-07-23-991-mcdonalda-085824
